2 CONT Sigmond, Frithjof Carl (b. 1883) — also known as Frithjof C. Sigmond — Born in Zumbrota, Goodhue County, Minn., April 26, 1883. U.S. Vice & Deputy Consul in Stavanger, 1911-14; U.S. Vice Consul in Bergen, 1917; Stavanger, 1922-32;
2 CONC  Stockholm, 1938-43. Burial location unknown. 
2 CONT
2 CONT (By Irene Røyneberg)
