1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Obituary from [http://www.canada.com/story.html?id=e58f5094-adc8-4844-8c3f-3fe19a1defd0 canada.com]:
2 CONT
2 CONT GRUDE, Jan Kristian Wessel Jan K. W. Grude, born 13 February, 1925 in Stavanger Norway, died 18 May, 2008. Jan emigrated to Canada 1956, and excelled in the hotel business from coast to coast. He began his Canadian career with CP 
2 CONC Hotels, branched out and became part owner of the Edmonton Inn and eventually owner of the Hotel Vega. Jan and his loving wife of 56 years, Elsa, raised a fine family of four wonderful children. Sadly, Jan was predeceased by one s
2 CONC on, Tore, in 1979. He will be greatly missed by his cherished family; his wife Elsa, his sons Jan Kristian and Eric and his daughter Jeannette, Jan Kristian's children Katrina, Nina, Martin and Elsa, Eric's children Kristin and Er
2 CONC ic Martin, Jeannette's daughter Tara, and great-grandchildren Leiv, Sebastian and Hailey, together with brother Egil and sister Edith in Norway, as well as by family and friends in Norway and all over Canada.
2 CONT
2 CONT Several of the MyHeritage trees insist that he was born in Sydney, New South Wales.
